// spec: INI-006
//
// ⚠️ Expected to FAIL compiled, because of C-8.
//
// Every failure the language reports exits with status 70.  This one is an
// uncaught raise; a scan, parse, resolution or type error reports the same
// status before any statement runs, which cannot be shown in the same file
// because such a program produces no output at all.

WriteLn ('this program raises');

raise 'boom';
